        },
        {
          "unit_index": 23,
          "verse": 7,
          "content_chars": 7,
          "text": "7 有些落在刺藤里，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 34,
          "verse": 9,
          "content_chars": 13,
          "text": "9 追随者问他这寓言是什么意思。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 35,
          "verse": 10,
          "content_chars": 4,
          "text": "10 他回答说："
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 36,
          "verse": 10,
          "content_chars": 30,
          "text": "“天上的 __MOST_HIGH_A__ 国的奥秘知识已经给你们了，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 37,
          "verse": 10,
          "content_chars": 8,
          "text": "但我对别人讲寓言，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 40,
          "verse": 10,
          "content_chars": 3,
          "text": "虽听见，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 43,
          "verse": 11,
          "content_chars": 7,
          "text": "11 “这寓言的意思是："
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 46,
          "verse": 12,
          "content_chars": 13,
          "text": "后来魔魔鬼来把心里的话夺走，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 51,
          "verse": 13,
          "content_chars": 6,
          "text": "他们暂时信了，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 60,
          "verse": 15,
          "content_chars": 6,
          "text": "灯架上的火炬"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 62,
          "verse": 16,
          "content_chars": 5,
          "text": "或放在床底。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 66,
          "verse": 17,
          "content_chars": 13,
          "text": "隐藏的秘密必被知道、显露出来。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 67,
          "verse": 18,
          "content_chars": 2,
          "text": "18 因此，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 69,
          "verse": 18,
          "content_chars": 4,
          "text": "有的人有，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 87,
          "verse": 22,
          "content_chars": 6,
          "text": "”他们上舟启航。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 88,
          "verse": 23,
          "content_chars": 3,
          "text": "23 行舟时，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 95,
          "verse": 24,
          "content_chars": 7,
          "text": "24 追随者去叫醒他，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 102,
          "verse": 24,
          "content_chars": 5,
          "text": "海面平静了。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 104,
          "verse": 25,
          "content_chars": 8,
          "text": "“你们的信心在哪里？"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 108,
          "verse": 25,
          "content_chars": 9,
          "text": "连风和水也听从他了！"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 112,
          "verse": 27,
          "content_chars": 15,
          "text": "27 __PERSON_F__ 上了岸，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 114,
          "verse": 27,
          "content_chars": 8,
          "text": "他住在那城里很久，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 115,
          "verse": 27,
          "content_chars": 4,
          "text": "不穿衣服，"
        },
